WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:05.814
An AI assistant with caldav-mcp and a demo calendar

00:05.814 --> 00:10.688
Ask what is on today's list

00:10.688 --> 00:19.910
It asks caldav-mcp for the events and tasks

00:19.910 --> 00:29.290
One meeting and four tasks today, one of them overdue

00:29.290 --> 00:34.655
Ask it to move the overdue task to tomorrow

00:34.655 --> 00:42.063
caldav-mcp saves the new due date on the server

00:42.063 --> 00:49.120
Done: the task is due tomorrow at the same time
